This product contains software derived from ByteDance Seed's
manip-as-in-sim-suite CDM depth pipeline.

The stack-convolution decoder contains concepts and code derived from MoGe.
The DeFM implementation contains code derived from ETH Zurich's DeFM project.
Individual vendored files retain their original copyright and SPDX notices.

The bundled `as-depth` 0.3.0 wheel exposes the canonical 20-model catalog and
the shared checkpoint/in-memory inference APIs. The integration supports the
active CDM, DeFM, DINOv2 stack-conv, DeFM stack-conv, sparse-raw, mask-normal,
and multitask families. Checkpoints, datasets, and runtime artifacts are not
included.

The older `asdepth_depth/models` tree remains only as a compatibility snapshot
for the original `defm_stackconv_depth` migration. New model selection and
inference must use the packaged `asdepth` catalog rather than extending that
snapshot.
